<h1 align="center"><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="3" color="#003366">How to 
  Join </font></h1>
<p>Hello to those interested 
  in joining our Random Acts family! </p>
<p>Please visit our pages <a href="candc.asp">The 
  Call and The Charter </a>to find out what we are about and how we like to interact 
  in EQ. Then take a trip to our page Fledgling Quest and see what types of things 
  we require upon joining. </p>
<p>Don't forget to visit our 
  Message Board to see who some of us are and the many things we talk about. If 
  you are still interested after all of this, place a posting within our Fledglings 
  and Prospective Members thread and send an e-mail to <a href="mailto:eqrandomacts@hotmail.com">eqrandomacts@hotmail.com</a>. 
  </p>
<p>Then hail any of us within 
  EQ and take the opportunity to meet us. </p>
<p>We have built our house 
  and family on practicing Random Acts of Kindness, helping others as we can and 
  most importantly treating each other and those we meet with respect and kindness. 
  </p>
